Apple CEO Tim Cook has <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/02/26/apple-teases-a-big-week-ahead/">teased "a big week ahead," with announcements starting Monday</a>. His post on X this week included an #AppleLaunch hashtag with a colorful Apple logo, along with a short video that ultimately reveals an Apple logo on the lid of a Mac.<br/>
<br/>
